# Argentum frontend application

## Install npm: https://docs.npmjs.com/downloading-and-installing-node-js-and-npm
## Install the tailwind css cli: https://tailwindcss.com/docs/installation
## Run the following command in the root of the FE application to start the tailwind CSS compiler:

[source,bash]
----
npm i
npx tailwindcss -i ./input.css -o ./assets/main.css --watch
----

Launch the FE application:

[source,bash]
----
dx serve --web
----


## Don't forget to run your Argentum backend application
